{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "交", "id": "交"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "肉", "id": "肉"}, {"form": "託", "id": "託"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "際", "id": "際"}, {"form": "餽", "id": "餽"}], "edges": [{"weight": 4.09016919081162, "source": "出", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.86702563949741, "source": "出", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 3.6847040827034556, "source": "出", "target": "入"}, {"weight": 1.3020762820358736, "source": "門", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 3.86702563949741, "source": "門", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.461560531389246, "source": "門", "target": "入"}, {"weight": 2.25758772706331, "source": "門", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.4807312783775197, "source": "餽", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.397022010251675, "source": "餽", "target": "肉"}, {"weight": 2.99155690214351, "source": "交", "target": "際"}, {"weight": 0.6089291014759282, "source": "後", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 0.6089291014759282, "source": "後", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.5644405465033646, "source": "後", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.075266170269355, "source": "後", "target": "託"}, {"weight": 0.7759831861390944, "source": "後", "target": "諸"}, {"weight": 2.2183670139100284, "source": "外", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.4807312783775197, "source": "際", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.4807312783775197, "source": "際", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.816204014665649, "source": "諸", "target":